WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:35.050
‎THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:33.930
Oh no…

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.850
That girl bumped into a eunuch,

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.100
which caused the ice to fall over.

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:44.100
-Poor thing…
-Poor thing?

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:46.360
I feel bad for the poor eunuch
who was carrying the ice.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:49.150
I hope he gets
nothing more than a whipping.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.110
I-I'm sorry…

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.830
Please excuse her.
She neglected to pay attention.

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:59.740
Do you think
an apology is going to fix this?!

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.370
Don't think this is not a big deal!

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.870
We don't have extra ice!

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.800
Damn it! What am I going to do?

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.380
Ice is very valuable,
especially in this season.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.430
It's so valuable that
it can even buy a person.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:23.480
Which consort was this ice for?

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.520
Consort Loulan.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.730
She requested ice for her evening dessert!

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:31.900
Of all consorts…

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:37.320
What do I do? I doubt she'll
accept money as compensation.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.910
To ruin the mood of a high-ranking consort
is also frightening.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:43.580
If only I could
prepare something in place of it…

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.290
Can I have this ice?

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:48.790
Do as you like!

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:51.210
All right. I will prepare something

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.300
in place of this ice.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:54.920
Could you deliver that to Consort Loulan

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:56.550
once it's prepared?

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.390
Go ahead and try.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.220
But you have less than an hour.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.600
I understand.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.310
Maybe I can make it.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:08.100
But will I be able to
gather all the ingredients I need?

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:11.270
Anyway, I gotta do what I can do.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.780
Why is he here?

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.780
This isn't the time to worry about that.

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:34.870
Episode 39: Ice

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:36.090
What should I do… Maomao?

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.430
Poor thing…

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:46.850
She got so excited after receiving
a hairpin from a consort,

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.270
and she wasn't paying
attention to where she was going.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.190
That consort…

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:54.150
Do you think she likes me?

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:57.360
She asked me to give her
a massage again next time.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.410
I'm happy for you.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:04.370
Since then, Xiaolan had been busy
looking for connections, and she was

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:07.660
so happy when she started receiving
requests from lower-ranking concubines.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.130
Even though
she was sold off by her parents,

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.800
she never once showed a sad face.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.880
She must've been so happy.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.100
Being yelled at and scolded like that

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.680
made her too scared to even move.

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.150
Do you need something?

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:40.150
Will you give me permission to use
the kitchen and some ingredients?

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.870
That's a quite selfish request.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.160
What do I get for helping you?

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.000
That attitude…

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.000
I don't have time for this!

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.750
I have nothing to give to you in return,
Lord Jinshi.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:55.670
But please give me permission.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.170
I know I'm not in a position
to ask him such a thing,

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.680
but I have no other choice.

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:05.180
What happened is not your fault though.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:08.430
Yes…

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.100
From the start,

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:14.360
she was only my source for gossip.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.070
Moreover,

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:19.360
I paid her back with snacks,
so I actually owe her nothing.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:24.570
I'm not obligated to help her.

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:26.870
But…

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.250
If I don't do anything,
I won't be able to sleep at night.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.800
Yeah? You won't be able to sleep, huh?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.010
Yes.

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.880
And it will impact my daytime duties.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:44.970
Well, I can't let that happen.

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:50.350
Fine, but on one condition.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:59.190
When someone is talking,
listen to them until the end.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.950
Is that it?

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.030
You say that, but you can't even do that.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.460
All right.
I guess I'll change the condition then.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.000
What shall it be?

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.750
I have a bad feeling about this!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.510
Maybe I should ask Lady Gyokuyou for help?

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:21.710
No…

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.430
I can't ask her to help me with something
that involves Lady Loulan.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.310
Thank you…

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.730
Do you not wear a hairpin?

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:41.070
All the maids
in the Jade Palace wear them.

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:44.320
Even if they do, it doesn't suit me…

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.070
I gave one to you at the garden party.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.870
Don't tell me you sold it?!

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.160
No, sir.

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:53.200
Not yet at least.

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:58.840
Go wear that then.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.590
Is that your condition?

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.340
Are you not satisfied?

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.260
After you wear it,

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.760
I will tell you.

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.640
I'll have the kitchen ready for you.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.160
I've brought them.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:31.490
-Please place them there.
-Got it!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.620
Maomao, these ingredients…

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.960
Sugar, fruits, and…

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.090
cow milk?

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.090
I'm glad we had fresh milk.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:46.340
Since cow's milk spoils quickly.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:51.100
Can we really make
a frozen dessert with these?

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.260
I think so.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:55.850
I've seen it being made once before.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.390
I'm counting on you.
This is our only chance!

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:00.150
I will call you once it is ready.

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.570
Mix this.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.080
What are you doing?!

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.830
I'm smashing the ice.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.290
They're so small now!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:23.710
Don't worry.

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:32.510
-This is good.
-Salt?

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:35.470
Xiaolan,
put that bowl into the bowl of ice.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.060
Yes!

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:49.490
What? No way!

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.490
It's hardening!

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.990
Xiaolan, cut the fruits into small pieces.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.630
Now, put in the cut fruit, and mix.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.460
And put it into a serving dish.

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.680
Is it done?

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.510
Is this…

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.850
Yes, it's ice cream.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:18.890
For now, this is good enough.

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:21.690
If I had more time, I could've added eggs

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:23.690
or added herbs for aroma.

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.770
Let's have him take it immediately.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.780
Yeah! But…

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.780
maybe we should taste it first.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:34.030
She's back to her normal self.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.950
You can taste the leftovers.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.000
Delicious!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.290
What happened?

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:47.590
Is it ready?

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:48.920
Please take this to her.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:52.880
Is this really okay to serve--

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:57.720
Is there a problem with it?

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:01.980
Please hurry and take it to Lady Loulan.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.060
Okay!

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:07.730
I'm so relieved…

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.730
Thank you so much, Maomao.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:13.820
Well, we still don't know
if Lady Loulan will like it.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.620
You meanie!

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:20.950
I asked Lord Jinshi
what she likes beforehand,

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.580
so I'm sure she will eat it.

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.170
Sheesh.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.960
Anyways, let's taste some more
before it all melts.

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:28.960
Yeah, let's taste!

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:31.840
-Oh, Shisui?
-What are you doing here?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.090
I heard about the commotion,

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.890
so I ditched work and came here.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:38.350
You're so bad!

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.060
This is delicious…

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:48.110
Hey! Don't eat it all, okay?

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:52.230
No…

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:57.410
-It's mine!
-No!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.660
-Don't eat it all!
-It's all mine now!

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.200
This isn't enough.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:05.290
-Give it!
-What the?!

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.540
Hey…

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:11.050
Maybe I can make one more batch.

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:12.800
-Wait!
-Okay, open.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.340
Delicious!

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:20.510
Now your turn, Shisui.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.310
Open wide.

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:33.320
Oh my.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.650
It's kicking.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.120
Lingli. You want to touch?

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:05.220
The baby will soon be born.

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:17.070
So far, the pregnancy is going well.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:19.570
How strange.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:23.120
Unlike Lingli, this baby kicks downward.

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:25.120
Downward?

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.500
I guess they're showing their personality
even before they are born.

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:38.920
May I touch your belly?

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.590
Yes, go ahead.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.850
Excuse me.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.570
May I ask how Princess Lingli's
delivery went?

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:02.070
The delivery was so smooth,
you wouldn't think it was the first time.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:06.080
She was quite small at birth,
so maybe that made it easier.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.950
Who delivered the baby?

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.120
I did.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:12.420
It's because the physicians
here aren't so great,

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:14.670
and the palace woman we hired
to help with the delivery

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:17.210
suddenly fell ill.

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.720
I was only able to assist because
I had studied about it beforehand.

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:23.050
Will you be hiring
that same palace woman this time?

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:24.260
No.

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:27.310
If she falls ill again when the time
comes, it will be troublesome.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:31.730
As a result, a different palace woman
assisted Lady Lihua's pregnancy.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:35.310
She was initially brought in
as a temporary midwife.

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.400
I see.

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:42.030
Do they plan to bring someone
from outside the rear palace this time?

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:44.030
Hongniang may have assisted

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.620
with the previous delivery,
however, it's not her specialty.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.750
If there's something on your mind,
tell me.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:56.710
I can't say for sure, but…

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.960
it might be a breech baby.

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.130
A breech baby?

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:03.130
Yes.

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:06.550
The baby seems to be kicking downward.

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.390
You said that when you were pregnant

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:10.310
with the princess,
she was kicking upwards.

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:12.060
That means her head was downwards.

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:15.810
When the largest part of the body,
the head, comes out first,

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.860
it makes the delivery smooth.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:21.440
But if the feet come out first,

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:24.820
it increases the risk of complications
during delivery.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.080
Are you sure it's a breech baby?

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:34.290
It's only a possibility.

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.670
A physical exam might make

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.210
it clearer.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.420
Can you do it?

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:44.470
I can't say for sure.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.720
My dad only taught me about medicine.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.310
Everything else
I've learned is just from observing.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:52.810
Please do it.

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:01.530
The method will be…

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:05.240
Is that so?

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:11.290
Compared to giving birth to Lingli,
that is nothing.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:15.500
Moms are strong.

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:20.920
Understood.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:35.730
How was it?

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.850
It's hard to say but…

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:41.900
The likelihood of a breech birth is high.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:46.490
There's a chance that the baby
will flip itself in the womb,

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.990
but it's late in her pregnancy.

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:52.740
What should I do?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.620
I heard in the please district

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:58.250
that moxibustion and exercise can help.

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:01.500
I can help with the moxibustion.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:03.130
Thank you.

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:05.010
I'll try to ask around for other methods

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.170
outside of the rear palace.

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:12.850
What will happen

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:16.310
if the baby's position doesn't change?

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:20.310
We will need to cut your body.

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:24.820
-I see.
-Lady Gyokuyou.

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:26.780
But if that happens,

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:28.860
that will put
Lady Gyokuyou's life at risk.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.530
Even if we have an experienced midwife,
it'd still be difficult.

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:36.450
Only if that quack doctor
was a more experienced doctor.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:38.830
But where can we find a substitute doctor?

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:43.960
Bringing a doctor into the rear palace

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:46.090
means they need to become a eunuch.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:49.170
Is there a skilled doctor
who's also a eunuch?

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:53.100
Yes. There's one person. He's perfect.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:55.180
But…

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:57.470
Maomao?

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.850
I know of one individual.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:03.860
Really?

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:06.570
His skills are top class,

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.320
and he has delivered babies
by means of surgery.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.030
Who may he be?

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:15.660
Don't tell me…

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.490
Is it Lord Jinshi's attendant?

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.500
Nope, it's a doctor.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:24.710
Suiren, did you do something?

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.710
What is he like?

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:31.130
He was banished from the rear palace.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:32.970
He's a criminal.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.890
I will not allow that!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:40.180
Lady Gyokuyou
and the baby's lives are at stake!

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:41.980
It must be someone who we can trust!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:45.230
You can trust him.
He's the best doctor in the country.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.400
It's not like you to be so stubborn.

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:53.570
But he's a criminal, right?

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:56.780
I cannot trust such a person.

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:59.290
-But!
-Hold on, you two.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:02.710
Hongniang, let her speak.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:05.290
And Maomao, please calm down.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.930
Tell me, what kind of sin did he commit?

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:15.220
He is a eunuch…

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.600
and he worked as a physician
in the rear palace.

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:21.520
In the past, he delivered
the emperor, the current heir,

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.150
and Lady Ah-Duo's child.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:28.900
The reason he was banished
from the rear palace

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.440
is related to Lady Ah-Duo, so I've heard.

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:35.660
It's not like I heard it
directly from my father,

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:37.200
or I know for sure.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:39.330
There are records,

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.790
but it's just speculation.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:46.330
How is he related to you, Maomao?

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:50.590
He's my adoptive father.
He also taught me about medicine.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.470
I understand.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:59.720
Let me ask Lord Jinshi
if he can have him come.

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:00.810
What?

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:01.850
Lady Gyokuyou!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:03.310
Hongniang,

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:05.940
I want someone capable to handle this.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:09.020
And if we can trust him,
then all the better.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:12.610
Also, I don't think he's a bad person.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.990
He can't be bad
if our stray cat is fond of him.

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:17.740
Stray cat?

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.990
-But he's a criminal!
-Hongniang!

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:23.040
You know the stories about

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.910
the rear palace back then, don't you?

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:28.710
You know just how many
were manipulated during

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:30.000
the era of the great empress.

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:32.800
We can't blindly believe

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.880
the accusations from that time.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:39.720
I understand.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.390
Now that we agree,

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:45.230
I will need to start writing a letter.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.230
Such strength…

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:51.480
So this is what it means to be a consort
and a mother-to-be.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.860
Two days later
after speaking with Lady Gyokuyou…

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:01.700
Thank you very much.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.700
We've been waiting for you, Luomen.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.180
My, my…

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:23.970
I never thought I'd be back here.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:27.230
A man looking like an old woman

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:28.520
entered the rear palace.

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.900
My name is Luomen.

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:36.110
As a temporary doctor,

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:40.030
I will be working at the medical office
of the rear palace.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:42.450
We've heard about you from Maomao.

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:44.030
Thank you for helping us.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:45.790
My pleasure.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:51.080
A temporary doctor, huh?

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.540
Well, I guess that makes sense.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:57.510
I was worried that the quack doctor
will be discharged,

00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:59.300
but I'm glad
I don't have to worry about that.

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:02.090
Excuse me then.

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:06.100
-Here you are.
-Yes.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:16.190
Hey, hey! That man
is your father, isn't he?

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:18.110
Well, I guess…

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:20.700
To be correct,
he's actually my grand uncle.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:24.450
He doesn't look anything
like I was expecting.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:28.370
He seems kind and gentle.

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.830
Yeah, like a normal person.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.080
Did he really raise you, Maomao?

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:35.880
I thought so too.

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:42.050
-You girls!
-Um, well--

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.510
What kind of guy were you imagining then?

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:48.680
That's hard to say, but…

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:50.930
He seemed like a decent man.

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:52.480
Agree!

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:56.230
How rude.

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:03.950
GREAT TREASURE

00:23:46.010 --> 00:24:00.950
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.930
Next episode: Festering Malice

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:00.930
